{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109278","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109278/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109278/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109278/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109278","id":3287363095,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7D8S4X","number":109278,"title":"POT generation for tooltips ignores `tooltip_auto_translate_mode`","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8133949121,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB5NI2wQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:i18n","name":"topic:i18n","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-08-03T17:10:46Z","updated_at":"2025-09-20T02:02:09Z","closed_at":"2025-09-20T02:00:44Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in:\n- 4.5.dev [45509c284]\n- 4.4.1.stable\n- 4.3.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta (c2202d36c) - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon 780M Graphics (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.12019.1028) - AMD Ryzen 7 8840HS w/ Radeon 780M Graphics (16 threads) - 15.28 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nPOT generation ignores the auto translate mode for tooltips (and possibly other cases, not using other cases so not sure what other areas are affected), this means that tooltips with `Always` selected but `Disable` selected on the control itself are ignored, and tooltips with `Disable` selected on controls with `Always` are included\n\nThis seems to be due to a overly simple check in the generator:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/45509c284cc8779f7e791b0d7dc3d639b3cc2fcc/editor/translations/packed_scene_translation_parser_plugin.cpp#L91-L99\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open the MRP\n- Open the project settings, go to `Localization > POT Generator`\n- Generate a new *separate* POT file from the existing `Out.pot` file\n- Check that it is missing:\n  - \"Should Appear Tooltip B\"\n  - \"Should Appear Tooltip C1\"\n- Check that it has the following incorrect entries:\n  - \"Should Not Appear Tooltip A\"\n  - \"Should Not Appear Tooltip B1\"\n\nNote when running the project that the tooltips and texts are correctly translated (displayed using pseudolocalization) so this is strictly an issue with the POT generator\n\nAs a workaround you can use the technique used in `Main.gd` which is how \"Should Appear Tooltip C2\" is correctly extracted:\n```gdscript\n$VBoxContainer/ButtonE.tooltip_text = \"Should Appear Tooltip C2\"\n```\n\nYou can similarly prevent it with the trick for \"Should Not Appear Tooltip B2\" using `# NO_TRANSLATE`:\n```gdscript\n$VBoxContainer/ButtonC.tooltip_text = \"Should Not Appear Tooltip B2\" # NO_TRANSLATE\n```\n\nThe workarounds are pretty trivial but for larger projects with cases where text shouldn't be translated it can grow large, especially having to separate where things are declared\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[POT_MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21567030/POT_MRP.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109278/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109278/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}